  "body": "The virtual keyboard shown for a password field is typically different from the one for text input.  For example, on Android devices the keyboard for passwords don't show suggestions, emojis, voice input etc.  The virtual keyboard on Windows shows a similar behavior as noted [here](https://github.com/MicrosoftEdge/MSEdgeExplainers/issues/88#issue-486625982).\r\n\r\nWe are proposing to add `inputmode=\"password\"` to the [spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#input-modalities:-the-inputmode-attribute) to match the native functionality.",
